 "name_en": "Convergent Invoicing – Revenue Sharing and Partner Settlement (42L)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Convergent Invoicing – Revenue Sharing and Partner Settlement (42L)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioeab6858ef72d480988d494d32f485bbf\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeab6858ef72d480988d494d32f485bbf__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item supports multi-sided business models such as revenue sharing and partner settlement. Based on defined criteria, a consumption or billable item with a specific revenue share can be created and paid to a partner.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeab6858ef72d480988d494d32f485bbf__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Partner Billable Item</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform Billing and Invoicing for Partner Billable Items</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeab6858ef72d480988d494d32f485bbf__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Drive new revenue streams associated with your extended ecosystem</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide functions to determine revenue share for third-party services consumed by an end customer</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集中开发票 – 收入分配和合作伙伴结算 (42L)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioeab6858ef72d480988d494d32f485bbf\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeab6858ef72d480988d494d32f485bbf__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持收入分配和合作伙伴结算等多边业务模型。根据定义的条件，可以创建具有特定收入份额的消耗或可开票项目并将其支付给合作伙伴。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeab6858ef72d480988d494d32f485bbf__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建合作伙伴可开票项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">对合作伙伴可开票项目执行开票和开发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeab6858ef72d480988d494d32f485bbf__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">推动与扩展生态系统相关的新收入流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提供功能，以确定最终客户使用的第三方服务的收入份额</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
